# LOOM-8 load test for the newer engines (2026-11-26: the old stress.xy has none of them): every track busy at
# once. T1 kit as stress.xy; T2 lace sixteenths (mallet); T3 tulle a held chord; T4 tartan eighth chords; T5 cane
# (koto) sixteenths; T6 jacquard (vowel pad) a held chord; T7 bellows (gospel) quarter chords; T8 acid sixteenths.
# Both effects sent, the master pumping. The host: the load model and each engine's share
master 4096
bpm 128
preset 2 lace lace
preset 3 tulle tulle
preset 4 tartan tartan
preset 5 koto cane
preset 6 vowel_pad jacquard
preset 7 gospel bellows
preset 8 acid_line acid
knob 11 engine delay
knob 12 engine lush
mst pump 40
mst pumpby kick

pat 1 1 16
hits 1 1 1 x...x...x...x...
hits 1 1 2 ....x.......x...
hits 1 1 3 xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
hits 1 1 4 ..x...x...x...x.
hits 1 1 5 .x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x
hits 1 1 6 x..x..x..x..x..x

pat 2 1 16
notes 2 1 1 1 100 C4
notes 2 1 2 1 85 E4
notes 2 1 3 1 100 G4
notes 2 1 4 1 85 B4
notes 2 1 5 1 100 D5
notes 2 1 6 1 85 G4
notes 2 1 7 1 100 E4
notes 2 1 8 1 85 C5
notes 2 1 9 1 100 C4
notes 2 1 10 1 85 E4
notes 2 1 11 1 100 G4
notes 2 1 12 1 85 B4
notes 2 1 13 1 100 D5
notes 2 1 14 1 85 G4
notes 2 1 15 1 100 E4
notes 2 1 16 1 85 C5

pat 3 1 16
notes 3 1 1 16 90 A2 E3 C4 G4

pat 4 1 16
notes 4 1 1 1 96 A3 C4 E4
notes 4 1 3 1 96 A3 C4 E4
notes 4 1 5 1 96 A3 C4 E4
notes 4 1 7 1 96 A3 C4 E4
notes 4 1 9 1 96 A3 C4 E4
notes 4 1 11 1 96 A3 C4 E4
notes 4 1 13 1 96 A3 C4 E4
notes 4 1 15 1 96 A3 C4 E4

pat 5 1 16
notes 5 1 1 1 100 A3
notes 5 1 2 1 85 C4
notes 5 1 3 1 100 E4
notes 5 1 4 1 85 A4
notes 5 1 5 1 100 A3
notes 5 1 6 1 85 C4
notes 5 1 7 1 100 E4
notes 5 1 8 1 85 A4
notes 5 1 9 1 100 A3
notes 5 1 10 1 85 C4
notes 5 1 11 1 100 E4
notes 5 1 12 1 85 A4
notes 5 1 13 1 100 A3
notes 5 1 14 1 85 C4
notes 5 1 15 1 100 E4
notes 5 1 16 1 85 A4

pat 6 1 16
notes 6 1 1 16 90 C4 E4 G4 B4

pat 7 1 16
notes 7 1 1 4 96 A3 C4 E4 G4
notes 7 1 5 4 96 F3 A3 C4 E4
notes 7 1 9 4 96 D3 F3 A3 C4
notes 7 1 13 4 96 E3 G#3 B3 D4

pat 8 1 16
notes 8 1 1 1 100 A1
notes 8 1 2 1 85 A1
notes 8 1 3 1 100 A2
notes 8 1 4 1 85 A1
notes 8 1 5 1 100 C2
notes 8 1 6 1 85 A1
notes 8 1 7 1 100 G1
notes 8 1 8 1 85 A2
notes 8 1 9 1 100 A1
notes 8 1 10 1 85 A1
notes 8 1 11 1 100 A2
notes 8 1 12 1 85 A1
notes 8 1 13 1 100 C2
notes 8 1 14 1 85 A1
notes 8 1 15 1 100 G1
notes 8 1 16 1 85 A2

scenedef 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
song 1:8
songloop 0

tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav loom_demo_stress_new.wav
tap PLAY
bars 8
wait 4000
wavstop
stats
